    "Use the strict decoder for native bundle and confirmation metadata; keep equivalent B2 decoding self-contained in the module identified by verifier_sha256.",
    "Preserve serialization, valid-record digests, explicit nulls and the distinction between integrity and scientific acceptance."
  ],
